    "text": "HOME\nCARS\nTEAM\nSUPPORT US\nCONTACT US\nFORCE RACING\nDream. Build. Race\nBecome our Partner\nForce Racing is a Formula Student team from Kakatiya Institute of Technology & Science.\nEstablished in 2009, Force Racing is a 60-member student team primarily from the Department of Mechanical Engineering. Each year, we design, manufacture, and compete with a formula-style race car in national and international Formula Student competitions.,\nOur mission is to develop industry-ready engineers by integrating rigorous technical execution with structured business and project management practices. Alumni of the team have progressed into high-performance motorsport environments and diverse engineering sectors, including Formula 1 and engineering consultancy.\nTHEY BELIEVED IN US\nADDRESS\nCentral Workshop\nKakatiya Institute of Technology & Science\nWarangal - 506015\nTelangana, India\nQUICK LINKS\nHOME\nCARS\nTEAM\nSUPPORT US\nCONTACT US\nGET IN TOUCH\nteam.force.racing.kitsw@gmail.com\n+91-8008391525\n© 2026 Force Racing India. All rights reserved.",
