    "text": "HOME\nCARS\nTEAM\nSUPPORT US\nCONTACT US\nJOIN OUR JOURNEY\nFUEL OUR JOUNEY\nYour support drives our pursuit of victory and\nelevates our engineering performance.\nHOW YOUR DONATION IS USED\nCRITICAL COMPONENTS\nSupports procurement of key elements such as\nbearings, fasteners, and Engine Parts\nCOMPLETE SUBSYSTEM\nFunds entire systems like engine, chassis,\nor carbon fiber manufacturing\nADVANCED SYSTEMS\nFinances Aerodynamic development, suspensions,\nand performance enhancements\nMAKE A CONTRIBUTION\nMake your Contribution through official KITS Warangal Payment Gateway.\nFast, Secure and convenient.\nPROCEED TO PAYMENT PORTAL\nYour support today drives our success tomorrow\nADDRESS\nKakatiya Institute of Technology & Science, Warangal - 506015 Telangana, India\nQUICK LINKS\nHOME\nCARS\nTEAM\nSUPPORT US\nCONTACT US\nGET IN TOUCH\nteam.force.racing.kitsw@gmail.com\n+91-8008391525\n© 2026 Force Racing India. All rights reserved.",
